msgstr "Advertentiekosten per bestelling"

#: front-end/ad-platforms/class-brikpanel-ads-dashboard.php:165
msgctxt ""
"compact KPI sub-label inside the ROAS card: ad spend divided by order count"
msgid "Cost / order"
msgstr "Kosten / bestelling"

#: front-end/ad-platforms/class-brikpanel-ads-dashboard.php:201
msgid "How Ad cost per order is calculated"
msgstr "Hoe de advertentiekosten per bestelling worden berekend"

#: front-end/ad-platforms/class-brikpanel-ads-dashboard.php:202
msgid "Ad spend for the selected period divided by the orders placed in it."
msgstr ""
"Advertentie-uitgaven voor de geselecteerde periode gedeeld door het aantal "
"bestellingen dat in die periode is geplaatst."

#: front-end/ad-platforms/class-brikpanel-ads-dashboard.php:203
msgid "Orders placed by store administrators are not counted."
msgstr ""
"Bestellingen die door winkelbeheerders worden geplaatst, worden niet "
"meegeteld."

#: front-end/ad-platforms/class-brikpanel-ads-dashboard.php:205
msgid ""
"Marketplace orders are not counted, because ad spend drives your own store."
msgstr ""
"Bestellingen via de marktplaats worden niet meegeteld, omdat advertentie-"
"uitgaven uw eigen winkel stimuleren."

